 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No motif on the idols or on the Name where it is the object of their abuse (108:9); geometric only for «إلى ربهم مرجعهم» and «إنما الآيات عند الله». «زينا لكل أمة عملهم» carries Al-Muyassar's «عقوبة لهم على سوء اختيارهم»; 110 carries As-Sa'di's «وهذا من عدل الله… جنوا على أنفسهم». Their oath (109) is framed as not sincere (As-Sa'di). STAGING v4: c1 (108): believers and idol-worshippers (3 men) in a market; no idol drawn, nobody insults (108:2 is a prohibition, 108:8-12 a consequence to avoid: no gesture there, the camera is on the believers). The worshippers speak in defence of their way on 108:17 (As-Sa'di). An uncountable crowd plate for every nation (108:16), geometric for the return to their Lord. c2 (109-110): the polytheists swear to the believers (Al-Muyassar: the believers are addressed on 109:15-16); the sign and their belief are conditional and not drawn; they shake their heads (109:20) and turn away (110:5, 110:13). Geometric for 109:12-14."
 },
